### Eligible MSISDN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "201055555555"
}

### Blacklisted MSISDN with multiple reasons
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "201066257228"
}

### Invalid MSISDN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "msisdn": "123"
}

### Operational status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/system/status
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Liveness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/actuator/health/readiness
